2026-10-15T18:16:37.3392634Z -- v4.0.3 — stale-plan guards, billed peaks, boundary clamps
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3392868Z   ok   a skew within one step length clamps to the FIRST step, not the last
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3393041Z   ok   beyond one step the plan says nothing about now: idle
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3393253Z   ok   the pre-horizon idle IS the empty-plan fallback, one shared dict
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3393436Z   ok   past the horizon the last step still answers, unchanged
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3393602Z   ok   before any solve the plan has no age and is not stale
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3393810Z   ok   three consecutive failed solves raise exactly one repair issue
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3393990Z   ok   the issue carries its translation key and placeholders
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3394152Z   ok   an hour-old plan is not yet stale (90-minute floor)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3394302Z   ok   past three missed cycles the plan is stale
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3394493Z   ok   the threshold scales with the configured update interval
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3394637Z   ok   a stale plan's schedule step is not applied
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3394904Z   ok   a fresh plan actuates exactly as before
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3395091Z   ok   fixed-rule modes carry no horizon and ignore staleness
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3395259Z   ok   new snapshots no longer carry the peak tracker at all
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3395456Z   ok   a learner rollback leaves the month's realised peaks alone
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3395639Z   ok   an old snapshot still carrying the key is simply ignored
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3395922Z   ok   from_config clamps zero and negative masses to the physical floor
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3396089Z   ok   direct construction runs through the same clamp
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3396306Z   ok   the service-write chokepoint re-clamps after attribute assignment
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3396455Z   ok   no sane configuration ever subdivides a step
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3396629Z   ok   the stiff case genuinely exercises the subdivision
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3396831Z   ok   a 24 h trajectory on the stiff house stays finite and bounded
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3396974Z   ok   a legacy naive last_fed loads as aware UTC
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3397151Z   ok   and release_if_starved subtracts it without raising
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3397305Z   ok   a fresh humidity reading feeds the mold floor
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3397596Z   ok   a frozen humidity sensor reads as no reading — the mold floor vanishes
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3397725Z   ok   a live inlet probe still wins
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3397914Z   ok   a probe frozen for two days degrades to the seasonal model
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3398122Z   ok   an unreachable Tibber is a connectivity verdict, not an auth one
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3398131Z 
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3398352Z -- v4.0.4 — DST-day exclusion from price learning
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3398541Z   ok   a Fri-Mon wrap covers Friday through Monday, inclusive
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3398730Z   ok   Saturday, Sunday and Monday are all inside a Fri-Mon wrap
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3398870Z   ok   Tuesday is outside a Fri-Mon wrap
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3399012Z   ok   a Fri-Mon wrap is not silently empty
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3399200Z   ok   the synthetic fold day really carries 25 hourly entries
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3399352Z   ok   a plain 24-hour day trains the hourly shape
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3399801Z   ok   the 25-hour autumn fold day is excluded — its collapse used to pass the 24-hour gate with a fabricated hour 2
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3399995Z   ok   the 23-hour spring gap day is excluded by the same predicate
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3400227Z   ok   quarter learning sees the same exclusion: plain day in, fold day out
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3400427Z   ok   naive timestamps carry one offset (None) and keep learning
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3400435Z 
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3400613Z -- v4.0.4 — negative-mean initial guess
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3400831Z   ok   a positive-mean horizon gets the historical formula bit for bit
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3401067Z   ok   all-negative prices: the cheapest (most negative) step starts highest
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3401279Z   ok   and the guess is monotone in price rank, inside the same 0.2-1.0 band
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3401474Z   ok   the un-guarded formula really did invert on this input
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3401695Z   ok   a near-zero mean takes the rank path instead of saturating the clip
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3401913Z   ok   sun entirely past the solve horizon moves no warm-start weight (#933)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3402119Z   ok   the same sun inside the horizon does discount (#933 null control)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3402305Z   ok   a zero-step lookahead leaves every weight at one (#933)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3402314Z 
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3402500Z -- v4.0.4 — grid-fee magnitude repair issue
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3402778Z   ok   max_abs_component finds the öre-as-SEK rule and names its source
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3402931Z   ok   an inactive layer has nothing to warn about
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3403115Z   ok   entity mode inspects the live value, rules mode ignores it
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3403374Z   ok   a 25 SEK/kWh rule — öre in a SEK field — raises the repair issue
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3403659Z   ok   warn-only: the plan still prices with exactly what was typed
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3403919Z   ok   the issue is raised once per offending value, not every cycle
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3404122Z   ok   a corrected configuration clears the issue on the next cycle
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3404358Z   ok   0.25 SEK/kWh — the value that was meant — raises nothing
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3404623Z   ok   a fee sensor publishing öre trips the same issue, attributed to it
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3404856Z   ok   a stored negative rule raises the sign notice, attributed to the rules
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3405087Z   ok   warn-only: the plan still prices with the negative value it was given
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3405303Z   ok   the sign notice is raised once per offending value, not every cycle
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3405541Z   ok   and a negative rate of ordinary size is not mistaken for a magnitude slip
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3405724Z   ok   correcting the sign clears the notice on the next cycle
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3406062Z   ok   a fee sensor publishing a negative value trips the same notice, attributed to it
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3406317Z   ok   the magnitude notice and the sign notice are independent: -25 raises both
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3406439Z   ok   0.25 SEK/kWh raises neither
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3406448Z 
