2026-10-15T18:16:37.3539303Z   ok   the terminal credit repays a stored buffer kWh at the flow-derated COP the simulation charged to store it, less what the tank loses first
2026-10-15T18:16:37.3539525Z   ok   and at -5 C that haircut is small: winter storage is not discouraged
