2026-10-15T18:16:37.5237689Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5237871Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5238001Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5238106Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5238198Z   ok   rejects end < start
