2026-10-15T18:16:37.5239049Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5239178Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5239455Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5239612Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5239721Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5239863Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5240000Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5240140Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5240322Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
