2026-10-15T18:16:37.5240623Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5240792Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5240941Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5241060Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
