2026-10-15T18:16:37.5241202Z 
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5241342Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5241501Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5241652Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5241783Z   ok   the override is flagged active
