2026-10-15T18:16:37.5242438Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5242579Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5242587Z 
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5242775Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5242996Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5243184Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5243430Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5243438Z 
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5243683Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5243926Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5244136Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5244392Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5244608Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5244783Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5244791Z 
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5245005Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5245238Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5245413Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5245561Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5245713Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5245721Z 
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5245970Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5246119Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5246240Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5246366Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5246562Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5246707Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5246839Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5246973Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5247180Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5247386Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5247579Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5247776Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5248022Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5248199Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5248394Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
