2026-10-15T18:16:37.5248774Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5248978Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5249197Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5249391Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5249570Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5249811Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5250039Z   ok   windows that only touch at an endpoint do not overlap, from either side
