2026-10-15T18:16:37.5252444Z -- Safety release fires only when a hard floor binds
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5252649Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5252796Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5252983Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5253148Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-10-15T18:16:37.5253316Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
